const card=document.createElement('section');card.id='flightcard';card.className='card';card.innerHTML=`<div class="cardhead"><h2>Flight · manual recording</h2><span id="flightphase" class="pill">No active flight</span></div><div class="body"><p><b>Manual flight timer and event log — no live aircraft telemetry.</b> Use before take-off and after landing, or ask ground crew to record events. No routine screen interaction is needed while flying. Follow aircraft warnings and your operating/emergency plan.</p><div class="flight-clock"><strong id="flightairbornestate">Not airborne</strong><output id="flightelapsed">00:00:00</output><span id="flighttimefacts"></span><span id="flightremaining"></span></div><p id="flightcontext" class="hint"></p><p id="flightlivestatus" role="status"></p><div class="inline"><button id="recordtakeoff" class="btn primary" type="button">Record take-off</button><button id="recordlanding" class="btn primary" type="button" disabled>Record landing</button><button id="recordabort" class="btn" type="button" disabled>Log abort / return intention</button></div><p class="hint">Import a briefing using Import flight records / app backup, then select its reference in Flight shown. Alternatively use the current setup. Ground events and take-off do not require a completed pre-flight. Linked briefings retain their original assessment. The timer uses timestamps, including time with the screen locked. It cannot detect take-off, landing or remaining charge.</p><details><summary>Quick event / note · optional</summary><label><span class="label">Event type</span><select id="flighteventtype"><option>Note</option><option>Conditions changed</option><option>Other aircraft observed</option><option>Battery alert</option><option>Loss of VLOS</option><option>Lost link</option><option>Return initiated</option><option>Emergency</option></select></label><label><span class="label">Observation / action taken · optional</span><textarea id="flighteventnote" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><button id="recordevent" class="btn" type="button">Log event</button></details><details><summary>Record an already-airborne flight / unknown outcome</summary><p>Factual recovery only: this does not approve a launch or reconstruct missing checks. The record will be labelled UNASSESSED.</p><label><span class="label">Actual take-off · London date/time · required for recovery</span><input id="recoverytakeoff" type="datetime-local"></label><label><span class="label">Reason / time source · required for recovery or unknown outcome</span><textarea id="recoveryreason" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><button id="recoverairborne" class="btn" type="button">Record already airborne · UNASSESSED</button><button id="unknownlanding" class="btn" type="button">Close active flight · landing/outcome unknown</button></details><details><summary>Cancel or postpone this plan · no flight recorded</summary><label><span class="label">Outcome</span><select id="canceloutcome"><option value="CANCELLED">Cancelled</option><option value="POSTPONED">Postponed</option></select></label><button id="cancelplan" class="btn" type="button">Record plan outcome</button></details><button id="recoverflightdownload" type="button" class="btn" hidden>Download unsaved flight-log recovery file</button><p id="flightlogstatus" class="hint" role="status"></p><details><summary>Flight events · recorded facts and corrections</summary><ol id="flightevents"></ol></details></div>`;
