const post=document.createElement('section');post.id='postflightcard';post.className='card';post.innerHTML=`<div class="cardhead"><h2>Post-flight · debrief & records</h2></div><div class="body"><label><span class="label">Recorded flight · stable reference</span><select id="sortieselect"><option value="">No recorded sorties</option></select></label><p id="sortiesummary" class="hint"></p><div id="debriefeditor"><label><span class="label">Outcome · required to complete debrief</span><select id="debriefoutcome"><option value="">Select…</option><option value="completed">Completed</option><option value="partial">Partially completed</option><option value="aborted">Aborted</option><option value="cancelled">Cancelled</option><option value="postponed">Postponed</option><option value="unknown">Unknown</option></select></label><label><span class="label">Landing charge · lowest fitted pack · % · optional if unavailable</span><input id="landingcharge" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="any" placeholder="Leave blank if not recorded"></label><label><span class="label">Per-pack landing readings / temperatures · optional</span><textarea id="landingpacknotes" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Pack ID, charge, temperature and measurement source if available"></textarea></label><label class="check"><input id="debriefnothing" type="checkbox"><span>Nothing to report — defects, warnings and incidents considered</span></label><label class="check"><input id="debriefdefect" type="checkbox"><span>Defect / damage / safety concern — quarantine selected aircraft/battery for review</span></label><label><span class="label">Debrief / defect / lesson · required when reporting a defect; otherwise optional</span><textarea id="debriefnote" maxlength="3000"></textarea></label><label><span class="label">Follow-up / maintenance action · required for a defect; otherwise optional</span><textarea id="debrieffollowup" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label><span class="label">Deliverables / reference · optional</span><input id="debriefdeliverables" maxlength="1000"></label><button id="savedebrief" class="btn primary" type="button">Save debrief revision</button><p class="hint">Incomplete debriefs can be saved. Each save appends a revision; the original briefing and events remain. Defects carry forward until a documented return-to-service decision.</p><details><summary>Correct recorded times · retains previous values</summary><p>Leave a time blank to record it as unknown. Corrections are pilot-entered and are not independently authenticated.</p><label><span class="label">Corrected actual take-off · London time</span><input id="correcttakeoff" type="datetime-local"></label><label><span class="label">Corrected actual landing · London time</span><input id="correctlanding" type="datetime-local"></label><label><span class="label">Correction reason · required</span><textarea id="correctreason" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><button id="correcttimes" class="btn" type="button">Append time correction</button></details><button id="downloadsorties" class="btn" type="button">Download flight/debrief report · HTML</button></div><p id="debriefstatus" class="hint" role="status"></p><div id="flighttotals" class="classhelp"></div><p class="hint">These are locally editable pilot records, not a certified or tamper-proof logbook. All-data JSON backups include these flight logs and revisions. Review private data before sharing reports.</p></div>`;
